  m_text: "Let\u2019s get you started on building your very own food court.\n\nFirst,
    unlock your first stall area to begin your business.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNow, select
    the stall and choose which food you want to sell.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nGreat! You now
    have your very first food court stall up and running.\n\nGoodluck!"
